WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.567
Report a bug from the failed test step.

2
00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:08.233
Give the report a clear title and choose its delivery route.

3
00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:12.833
Choose the YouTrack delivery route.

4
00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:16.350
Create the bug with its YouTrack delivery route.

5
00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.050
Open the linked issue in YouTrack.

6
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.250
The issue includes the reproduction steps and testing context.

7
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.400
Compare the expected and actual results directly in YouTrack.
